hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1512","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne aik raat khwab mein dekha, jaisa sonay wala dekhta hai, ke goya ham Uqba bin Rafi ke ghar mein hain. To hamaray paas Ibn Taab ki taza khajoorein layi gayeen. To main ne taabeer ki ke hamaray liye duniya mein bulandi, aakhirat mein anjaam aur hamara deen pakeeza hai. (Muslim: 7/57)"
"1513","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Main ne khwab mein dekha ke main Makka se aisi zameen ki taraf hijrat karta hun jis mein khajoorein hain. To mera wehem Yamama ya Hajar ki taraf gaya, phir wo Madina, Yasrib nikli. Aur main ne apne is khwab mein dekha ke main ne talwaar hilayi to us ka upar wala hissa toot gaya. To wo wohi hai jo Uhud ke din mominon ko pahuncha. Phir main ne usay doosri baar hilaya to wo pehle se behtar ho gayi. To wo wohi hai jo Allah fatah aur mominon ke ijtema se le kar aaya. Aur main ne us mein gaayein bhi dekhin, aur Allah khair hai. To wo Uhud ke din mominon ka giroh hain. Aur khair wohi hai jo Allah us ke baad khair se le kar aaya aur sachai ka sawab jo Allah ne hamein Badr ke din ke baad diya. (Muslim: 7/57). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka Musailima Kazzab aur Ansi Kazzab ka khwab. (Asal mein hazaztu wa hazaztahu ka izafa hai jo Muslim ya Ibn Majah mein nahi; Ahmad ne Ibn Abbas ki hadees mein tuzbah ka izafa kiya hai, gaaye ka zibah hona Uhud mein shaheed sahaba ka qatl hai.)"
"1514","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Musailima Kazzab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein Madina aaya aur kehnay laga ke agar Muhammad mujhe apne baad hukumat de dein to main un ki pairwi karun. To wo apni qaum ke bohat logon sameet wahan aaya. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ki taraf aaye jabke Aap ke saath Sabit bin Qais bin Shammas thay aur Nabi ke haath mein khajoor ki tehni ka tukra tha, yahan tak ke Musailima ke paas us ke saathiyon mein khaday hue. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum mujh se ye tukra mango ge to main tumhein na dun ga, aur main tumharay baaray mein Allah ke hukm se aagay nahi badhun ga. Aur agar tum peeth phero ge to Allah tumhein halak karay ga. Aur beshak main tumhein wohi samajhta hun jo mujhe tumharay baaray mein dikhaya gaya, aur ye Sabit meri taraf se tumhein jawab de ga. Phir Aap us se wapas hue. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke qaul ke baaray mein poocha ke beshak main tumhein wohi samajhta hun jo mujhe dikhaya gaya. To mujhe Abu Huraira ne bataya ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jabke main soya hua tha, main ne apne donon haathon mein sonay ke do kanghan dekhay. To un ka muamla mujhe fikarmand kar gaya. To khwab mein meri taraf wahi ki gayi ke unhein phoonk maaro. To main ne unhein phoonka aur wo ur gaye. To main ne un ki taabeer do jhootay ki jo mere baad niklein ge. To un mein se aik Sana ka Ansi tha aur doosra Yamama ka Musailima tha. (Muslim: 7/57-58). (Ulama ne kaha: Sabit bin Qais Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke khateeb thay jo wufood ke khutbaat ka jawab detay thay.)"
"1515","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhay wo jald mujhe bedaari mein dekhay ga, ya goya us ne mujhe bedaari mein dekha. Shaitaan meri soorat nahi bana sakta. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Phir Abu Salama ne kaha: Abu Qatada ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujhe dekha us ne haq dekha. (Muslim: 7/54). Baab: Khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitaan ki taraf se."
"1516","[AI-translation] Abu Salama se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Qatada ko kehtay hue suna: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitaan ki taraf se hai. To jab tum mein se koi napasandeeda cheez dekhay to apne baayein teen baar thookay aur Allah se us ke shar se panah mangay, beshak wo usay nuqsan nahi pahunchaye gi. To us ne kaha: Beshak main khwab dekhta tha jo mujh par pahar se bhaari hota tha. To jab main ne ye hadees suni to main us ki parwa nahi karta, Muslim mein hai ke phir main. (Muslim: 7/51). Baab: Acha khwab Allah ki taraf se hai, aur jo napasandeeda dekhay wo usay bayan na karay."
"1517","[AI-translation] Abu Salama se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main khwab dekhta tha jo mujhe beemar kar deta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Abu Qatada se mila. To us ne kaha: Aur main bhi khwab dekhta tha jo mujhe beemar kar deta tha, Muslim mein in nahi hai, yahan tak ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Acha khwab Allah ki taraf se hai. To jab tum mein se koi pasandeeda cheez dekhay to usay usi se bayan karay jis se wo mohabbat karta ho. Aur agar napasandeeda dekhay to apne baayein teen baar thookay aur Allah se shaitaan ke shar aur us ke shar se panah mangay, aur usay kisi se bayan na karay, beshak wo usay nuqsan nahi pahunchaye gi. (Muslim: 7/51-52). Baab: Jab napasandeeda dekhay to panah mangay aur jis pehlu par tha us se phir jaye."
"1518","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi napasandeeda khwab dekhay to apne baayein teen baar thookay, Allah se shaitaan se panah mangay, Asal mein ar-rajim ka izafa hai jis ki Muslim ya Ahmad, Abu Dawood, Ibn Majah mein koi asal nahi, teen baar, aur jis pehlu par tha us se phir jaye. (Muslim: 7/52). Baab: Momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"1519","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chiyalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai. (Muslim: 7/53). (Agli hadees mein paintalees hai, Sahihain ke bahar aur aadaad hain. Ulama ne kaha ke ye ikhtilaf dekhnay walay ke ikhtilaf ki taraf raje hai, jitna wo naik hoga us ka hissa kam tadaad mein hoga.)"
"1520","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab zamana qareeb ho jaye, yani us ka aakhir qareeb ho, to Musalman ka khwab taqreeban jhoota nahi hota. Aur tum mein sab se sachay khwab walay sab se sachay kalaam walay hain. Aur Musalman ka khwab nabuwwat ke paintalees hisson mein se aik hissa hai. Aur khwab teen hain: Acha khwab Allah ki taraf se khushkhabri hai, ghamgeen karnay wala khwab shaitaan ki taraf se hai, aur khwab jo aadmi apne nafs se baatein karta hai. Phir agar tum mein se koi napasandeeda dekhay to khada ho aur namaz padhay, aur usay logon se bayan na karay. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe qaid pasand hai aur tooq napasand hai, aur qaid deen mein mazbooti hai. To mujhe maloom nahi ke ye hadees mein hai ya Ibn Sirin ne kaha. (Muslim: 7/52). Baab: Khwab ki taabeer mein jo aaya."
"1521","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba se, Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo bayan kartay thay ke aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main aaj raat khwab mein saya dekhta hun jis se ghee aur shehad tapaktay hain. To main logon ko dekhta hun ke wo us mein se apne haathon se le rahay hain, koi zyada aur koi kam. Aur main aasmaan se zameen tak mila hua rassa dekhta hun. To main Aap ko dekhta hun ke Aap ne usay pakra aur upar chadhay, phir Aap ke baad aik mard ne usay pakra aur upar chadha, phir doosray mard ne usay pakra aur upar chadha, phir doosray mard ne usay pakra to wo us se toot gaya, phir us ke liye jor diya gaya aur wo upar chadha. To Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mere maan baap Aap par qurban. Allah ki qasam Aap mujhe chhorein ge to main zaroor us ki taabeer karun ga. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ki taabeer karo. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Raha saya to Islam ka saya hai, aur raha jo ghee aur shehad tapakta hai to Quran, us ki mithas aur narmi hai. Aur raha jo log us mein se letay hain to Quran se zyada lenay wala aur kam lenay wala hai, Muslim mein minhu nahi hai. Aur raha aasmaan se zameen tak mila hua rassa to wo haq hai jis par Aap hain, Aap usay pakarte hain to Allah Aap ko us se buland karta hai, phir Aap ke baad aik mard usay pakarta hai to us se buland hota hai, phir doosra mard usay pakarta hai to us se buland hota hai, phir doosra mard usay pakarta hai to wo us se toot jata hai, phir us ke liye jor diya jata hai to wo us se buland hota hai. To mujhe bataiye, Ae Allah ke Rasool, mere maan baap Aap par qurban, Asal mein ummi ke upar kha harf hai jo nuskhay ki zyadati ki alamat hai, Muslim mein nahi aaya. Kya main ne sahih kaha ya ghalat? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne baaz sahih kaha aur baaz ghalat. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Ae Allah ke Rasool, Aap mujhe zaroor batayein ge ke main ne kya ghalat kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Qasam na khao. (Muslim: 7/55-56). Baab: Shaitaan ke khwab mein khelnay ki khabar na de."
"1522","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik dehati Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne khwab mein dekha ke goya mera sar maara gaya aur ludhak gaya. To main us ke peechay dauda. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dehati se farmaya: Logon ko shaitaan ke tumharay saath tumharay khwab mein khelnay ki khabar na do. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us ke baad khutba detay hue suna. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shaitaan ke us ke saath us ke khwab mein khelnay ki khabar na de. (Muslim: 7/55)"
